OL,3,GNEWSAThe Big Issue's 'fantastic impact'
OL,4,Aover 35 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Big Issue vendor from Brighton has
OL,7,Fsaid selling the weekly newspaper,
OL,8,Fwhich is celebrating its 35th birthday
OL,9,Fthis year, saved his life.
OL,11,FVendor Andy Sanguy said he began
OL,12,Fselling the magazine when at his lowest
OL,13,Febb after he had "lost everything" but
OL,14,Fprofit from sales now boosts his
OL,15,Fincome.
OL,17,FThe Big Issue was founded in September
OL,18,F1991 by the now Lord John Bird and
OL,19,FGordon Roddick to help address the
OL,20,Fissue of homelessness in London.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
