OL,3,GNEWSAThe Big Issue's 'fantastic impact'
OL,4,Aover 35 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FSanguy is one of more than 110,000
OL,7,Fpeople nationally who have been helped
OL,8,Fby the paper, according to support
OL,9,Fco-ordinator Lewis Knight, who spoke of
OL,10,Fits "fantastic impact" over the years.
